Package: com.yiffysec.wambamvcam
Name: Wam Bam A Free Cam
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: A virtual camera that actually works, and is actually free.
 Replaces the camera feed system-wide or per app with your own video or photo,
 on iOS 15 through 26+, across rootful, rootless and roothide jailbreaks.
 .
 Hooks the capture graph where it actually lives: cameracaptured on iOS 18 and
 newer, mediaserverd before that. Ships a companion app with the full control
 set, an optional SpringBoard HUD, a Settings pane, and a boot-loop kill switch
 so a bad frame never costs you a restore.
Maintainer: yiffysec <https://github.com/yiffysec>
Author: yiffysec <https://github.com/yiffysec>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), ellekit | mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, com.opa334.libsandy
Homepage: https://github.com/yiffysec/Wam-Bam-A-Free-Cam-VCam
Depiction: https://github.com/yiffysec/Wam-Bam-A-Free-Cam-VCam
Tag: role::hacker
